msgstr "Modelo"

#: setting.py:489
msgid ""
"What the provider says about the selected model. The reply limit is the one that matters most here: a chunk is answered with a translation about as long as the chunk itself, so it is what a request can be sized against.\n"
"\n"
"Shown for engines whose model listing publishes the figures (OpenRouter today), and only after the list has been fetched."
