#: setting.py:812
msgid ""
"Ask OpenRouter to report, with every reply, the tokens as the provider counted them and what the request cost. On by default: it is one more event at the end of the stream and nothing on the bill, and it is what the report of a run adds up. Off, the tokens are estimated and the cost is unknown."
